1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,600
A little space for yourself.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:08,300
New ways to move, breathe,
and find a quieter moment.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,300
Seven minutes of movement.

4
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:18,400
Twelve exercises, an animated guide,
and time to rest.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,700
Follow twenty-four-form Tai Chi,
one movement at a time.

6
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:29,300
Return to the parts
you want to practise.

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,900
Let little habits earn little rewards.

8
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:39,400
Collect coins, then spend them
on treats you choose.

9
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,900
Keep a little of today.

10
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:49,400
Write in Markdown, and keep photos
beside the moments you record.

11
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:55,200
Lumi is here when you need
a little help.

12
00:00:55,200 --> 00:01:00,400
Change a theme, start a practice,
or find your way around.

13
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:05,300
Inner Breeze. Make room for you.

14
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,400
Begin with one small practice.
